r customization\n\n\u25a0 Simple UI and easy control can help anyone to play\n\n\u25a0 5 different difficulties from beginner to professional\n\n* The game format is the same as the official Olympic rules, so you can learn sports training and rules.\n* Suitable for virtual reality sports classrooms that must be conducted indoors due to physical education facilities and weather conditions.", "short_description": "10 Sports in 1 Game ! What type of sports acitivities will be safer during the pandemic era? All in One sports VR offers the most safe way to keep you healthy for both physically and mentally with zero contact."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.appnori.com/policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Appnori Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.appnori.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SIMULATION", "SPORTS", "CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "532887294520410"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 16, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "29934854606203275"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "1681723637007309"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1069244145719358"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1051616784315538"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1994433638616164"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1205288334552212"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1593105948374430"}, {"status": "PUBLIS